      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.34,
      "end_seconds": 36.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.96,
      "text": "I've had it since Friday i looked a few things up online, and and that probably didn't help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.98,
      "end_seconds": 46.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
