      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.74,
      "end_seconds": 80.31,
      "duration_seconds": 29.57,
      "text": "it's once or twice a day i notice it more with warm rooms and caffeine i'm not great at remembering details, you know, so bear with me oh, and vaginal dryness that's been about the same, six months about vaginal dryness, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day"
    },
    {
