      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.56,
      "end_seconds": 106.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.53,
      "end_seconds": 131.0,
      "duration_seconds": 13.47,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.4 degrees, pressure 113 over 78, heart rate 80. And BMI works out to 29.3, weight 95 kilos, height 180 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.21,
      "end_seconds": 135.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "I'd like to examine you now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.17,
      "end_seconds": 136.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.32,
      "end_seconds": 140.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Let me just check something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.2,
      "end_seconds": 162.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "blood pressure and pulse are fine, and there are no breast lumps on examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.18,
      "end_seconds": 163.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.92,
      "end_seconds": 174.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Thanks for that. And what about heavy bleeding, weight loss, palpitations or bleeding after sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.07,
      "end_seconds": 182.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "Oh, uh, no, no heavy bleeding, weight loss, palpitations or bleeding after sex."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.77,
      "end_seconds": 185.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.96,
      "end_seconds": 194.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "No, um, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.9,
      "end_seconds": 198.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.61,
      "end_seconds": 204.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "No, you know, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
