      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.57,
      "end_seconds": 244.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.05,
      "end_seconds": 252.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "I've never smoked. I'm mostly vegetarian. I work in an office, mostly sitting at a desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.84,
      "end_seconds": 266.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.21,
      "end_seconds": 272.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.71,
      "end_seconds": 290.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with perimenopausal symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.53,
      "end_seconds": 294.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Is this gonna go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.99,
      "end_seconds": 319.91,
      "duration_seconds": 23.92,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now perimenopausal symptoms is my leading thought, not anything worse. We should do a thyroid test for hot flushes. I'd like to arrange blood tests for irregular periods. Layers of clothing, a fan by the bed, and cutting down on caffeine and spicy food can help the flushes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.82,
      "end_seconds": 330.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Do I need a bone density scan? I read it might help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.28,
      "end_seconds": 340.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.01,
      "text": "Right, not right now, it wouldn't change what we do today. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
